s=\"rounded-xl border-2 border-border-soft bg-white p-6 md:p-8 shadow-md\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-secondary\">Send Us A Message</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-foreground/55 mt-1\">Fill this out and a mentor from your chosen track will reach out.</p><form class=\"mt-6 space-y-4\" noValidate=\"\"><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-secondary\">Full Name</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your name\" class=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-border-soft px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40\" name=\"name\"/></div><div><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-secondary\">Phone Number</label><input type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+91 98765 43210\" class=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-border-soft px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40\" name=\"phone\"/></div></div><div><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-secondary\">Email Address</label><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" class=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-border-soft px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40\" name=\"email\"/></div><div><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-secondary\">Course You&#x27;re Interested In</label><select name=\"course\" class=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-border-soft px-4 py-2.5 text-sm bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Select a course</option><option value=\"Not sure yet\">Not sure yet — need guidance</option></select></div><div><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-secondary\">Message</label><textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Tell us a bit about your background and what you&#x27;re hoping to learn...\" class=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-border-soft px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/40 resize-none\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-gradient w-full rounded-full py-3.5 text-white font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform disabled:opacity-70 disabled:translate-y-0\">Send Message <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send size-4\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg></button></form></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-secondary text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-16 pb-8\"><div class=\"mb-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/20 to-accent/10 border border-white/10 p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Stay in the loop</h3><p class=\"text-white/60 mt-1 text-sm md:text-base\">New courses, free workshops, and placement tips — straight to your inbox, no spam.</p></div><form class=\"flex w-full md:w-auto gap-2\"><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\" class=\"flex-1 md:w-72 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-sm placeholder:text-white/40 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-gradient rounded-lg px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold shrink-0 shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors\">Subscribe<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send size-4\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.